{'symbol': 'BSX', 'date': '2022-02-15 07:00:00', 'title': 'BOSTON SCIENTIFIC CLOSES ACQUISITION OF BAYLIS MEDICAL COMPANY INC.', 'text': 'MARLBOROUGH, MASS., FEB. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BOSTON SCIENTIFIC CORPORATION (NYSE: BSX) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE CLOSE OF ITS ACQUISITION OF BAYLIS MEDICAL COMPANY INC., A COMPANY THAT OFFERS ADVANCED TRANSSEPTAL ACCESS SOLUTIONS AS WELL AS GUIDEWIRES, SHEATHS AND DILATORS USED TO SUPPORT CATHETER-BASED LEFT-HEART PROCEDURES.'}